// Validate a save name from the entry line: refuse on a full disk,
// strip the extension, confirm an overwrite through NormalDialog's
// ACCEPT slot (pre-armed so a fresh name passes), then commit the
// bare name to the SaveGame handshake cell and rewrite the default
// NEWGAME buffer (a real .data buffer retail strcat's the current
// extension onto - the same cell CSaveGameEdit::OnKeyPress screens).
// The "." / "%s%s" literals pool onto advmgr's claimed copies.
// E:\gamedcs\singleselectionwindow.cpp:230
